{"name":"First Snow","hex":"#e8eff8","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"first","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Preceding all others of a series or kind; the ordinal of one; earliest.","Most eminent or exalted; most excellent; chief; highest."]},{"part":"Adverb","definitions":["Before anything else; firstly.","For the first time."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/first"},{"term":"snow","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The partly frozen, crystalline state of water that falls from the atmosphere as precipitation in flakes; also, the falling of such flakes; and the accumulation of them on the ground or on objects as a white layer.\n\n An instance of the falling of snow (etymology 1, noun sense 1); a snowfall; also, a snowstorm.","An instance of the falling of snow (etymology 1, noun sense 1); a snowfall; also, a snowstorm."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["Preceded by the dummy subject it: to have snow (noun etymology 1, noun sense 1) fall from the atmosphere.","Of a thing: to fall like snow."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/snow"}],"entries":[{"title":"Mighty Mouse","blocks":[{"text":"Mighty Mouse is an American animated character created by the Terrytoons studio for 20th Century Fox. He is an anthropomorphic superhero mouse, originally called Super Mouse, who made his debut in the 1942 short The Mouse of Tomorrow. The character's name was changed to Mighty Mouse in his eighth film, 1944's The Wreck of the Hesperus, and the character went on to star in 80 theatrical shorts, concluding in 1961 with Cat Alarm."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/23/Mighty_Mouse.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mighty_Mouse"},{"title":"First Snow (1958 film)","blocks":[{"text":"First Snow (Korean: 초설) is a 1958 South Korean film directed by Kim Ki-young."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/First_Snow_(1958_film)"},{"title":"First Snow (2006 film)","blocks":[{"text":"First Snow is a 2006 thriller starring Guy Pearce and directed by Mark Fergus. The film was released on March 23, 2007."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/9/94/Firstsnowposter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/First_Snow_(2006_film)"},{"title":"Snow","blocks":[{"text":"Snow is a form of solid atmospheric precipitation consisting of individual ice crystals that grow while suspended in the air—usually within clouds—and then fall, accumulating on the ground, where they undergo further changes. It consists of frozen crystalline water throughout its life cycle, starting when, under suitable conditions, the ice crystals form in the atmosphere, increase to millimeter size, precipitate and accumulate on surfaces, then metamorphose in place, and ultimately melt, slide, or sublimate away."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/CargoNet_Di_12_Euro_4000_L%C3%B8nsdal_-_Bolna.jpg/330px-CargoNet_Di_12_Euro_4000_L%C3%B8nsdal_-_Bolna.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Snow"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/0/04/Mighty_Mouse_%28original_blue_version%29.png/250px-Mighty_Mouse_%28original_blue_version%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/04/Mighty_Mouse_%28original_blue_version%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/0/04/Mighty_Mouse_%28original_blue_version%29.png/250px-Mighty_Mouse_%28original_blue_version%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Mighty Mouse, as the character originally appeared, wearing a costume reminiscent of Superman's.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMighty_Mouse_(original_blue_version).png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/d3/Mighty_Mouse_-_The_Littlest_Tramp.png/330px-Mighty_Mouse_-_The_Littlest_Tramp.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/d3/Mighty_Mouse_-_The_Littlest_Tramp.png/330px-Mighty_Mouse_-_The_Littlest_Tramp.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Stills from the Mighty Mouse: The New Adventures episode \"The Littlest Tramp\". Top left: the flower is crushed by the rich man. Top right: Mighty Mouse receives the remains of the flower, which falls apart in his hand. Bottom left: Mighty Mouse thinks fondly of the girl, and brings out what's left of the flower. Bottom right: Mighty Mouse smells the flower, inhaling it in the process.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMighty_Mouse_-_The_Littlest_Tramp.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Mighty_Mouse.jpg/330px-Mighty_Mouse.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Mighty_Mouse.jpg/330px-Mighty_Mouse.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Apple Mighty Mouse","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMighty_Mouse.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d4/Choseol_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d4/Choseol_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AChoseol_poster.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/Feb242007_blizzard.gif/500px-Feb242007_blizzard.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.